    "visual_comparison": "Replacement avoids prior silver-ring housing ambiguity: actual enlarged nose crop shows early fully fluted/ribbed twin-round reflector lens surfaces, amber outer corner, narrow kidney, black bumper rub strip, long low intake and long oval corner fog lamps, positively corresponding European09.1995–08.2000 E39 catalog-3. This is not the facelift smooth clear angel-eye housing or round-fog bumper. Conventional four-door trunk body. Exact engine/year not independently certified."
